35|{% if demo.held %}<p class="notice">clock held: awaiting approval</p>{% endif %}
36|<p>Model calls: {{ demo.model_calls }}{% if demo.last_model_call_at %} (last: {{ demo.last_model_call_at }}){% endif %}</p>
37|<p>Model: {% if demo.live %}live ({{ demo.model }}){% else %}scripted replay{% endif %}</p>
38|<p>cost: {% if demo.live %}{{ "$%.4f"|format(view.header.cost_usd) }}{% else %}n/a (scripted){% endif %}</p>
39|{% if demo.exhausted %}<p class="notice">script ended: switch act to restart</p>{% endif %}
40|<p id="stale">updated: reload</p>
41|</header>
42|<h1>Incident {{ view.id }}</h1>
43|<p>Deployment: {{ view.deployment }} | State: {{ view.state }}{% if view.reason %} | Reason: {{ view.reason }}{% endif %}</p>
